('95a7cae9-bfcb-5996-b1f7-d60858288fbd'::uuid, 'f957b0fc-b812-5e34-9a27-342f30f56922'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '(doc review 6 Nov 2026) CDRRMC Res. No. 09 s.2024 (29 Nov 2024) adopts the Incident Command System as the standard management system for planned and unplanned events in Ormoc and directs the CDRRMO to train city and barangay officials and responders, integrate ICS into plans, drills and simulations, and evaluate its use. No Mayor''s EO, IMT roster or pre-designated Incident Commanders in the set. CDP PPA 3.3 funds "EOC and ICS support".'),
('4ce60931-5f40-5664-becb-2757df8fa76b'::uuid, '825ed90c-7e68-5c52-9c7f-ccb54e1e3727'::uuid, 'fgd', 'verbal'::public.evidence_strength, 'CDRRMO field self-assessment (FGD), October 2026', 'CDRRMO section FGDs', 'continuous training needed; EO needs updating.'),
