('2596f9ac-298f-5cb0-a0f8-77011436ce71'::uuid, '4fa4d322-826b-56f4-b035-bb48d48d24e2'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', 'recovery plan using PlanSmart Ready to Rebuild is a planned PPA in 10-Yr Plan.'),
('f63d88b5-2ba5-5b16-a564-9da8a3bcb517'::uuid, '4fa4d322-826b-56f4-b035-bb48d48d24e2'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '(doc review 6 Nov 2026) CDP 2024-2030 PPA 4.1 plans a TWG for the Disaster Rehabilitation and Recovery Plan, PlanSmart Ready to Rebuild training and formulation and updating of the DRRP; no TWG order in the set.'),
('61993188-99b6-5c22-b922-7a5e2ca5dcce'::uuid, '5b252962-c5ba-5b3c-a5a8-a493b600a9a0'::uuid, 'fgd', 'verbal'::public.evidence_strength, 'CDRRMO field self-assessment (FGD), October 2026', 'CDRRMO section FGDs', 'political dynamics; for reframing.'),
('71977a2a-a1f5-51ce-bff4-d9e1f4105464'::uuid, '5b252962-c5ba-5b3c-a5a8-a493b600a9a0'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '(issuances 2021-2024, read 6 Nov 2026) after Typhoon Odette (Dec 2021) the City sent cash aid to other LGUs: CDRRMC Res. 12, 14 and 15 s.2021 and SP Res. 2021-365, -367 and -369 (to five Southern Leyte LGUs, to Cebu City and the Province of Cebu, and to five Leyte LGUs; SP 2021-365 authorises PHP 11.24 M from the 2021 Quick Response Fund, including PHP 1 M each to the five Southern Leyte LGUs), and SP Res. 2021-368 donated rice. This shows willingness to help neighbours but no standing reciprocal agreement, so the score stays 1.'),
('e5527dc2-6592-58ec-a855-af1d9cedc3b4'::uuid, '7ee40260-e492-57cb-bc61-911289ee9ea8'::uuid, 'fgd', 'verbal'::public.evidence_strength, 'CDRRMO field self-assessment (FGD), October 2026', 'CDRRMO section FGDs', 'execution instruments in place.'),
('4e28566c-af46-538c-9f6c-42ba41311801'::uuid, '7ee40260-e492-57cb-bc61-911289ee9ea8'::uuid, 'document', 'approved_in_use'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', 'EDC partnership cited in 10-Yr Plan. [Imported at "approved and in use" from the assessor''s score. Attach the document and proof of use, or lower the strength, at validation.]'),
('e3d22801-12d3-5e57-8eb3-9e7923f3077f'::uuid, '7ee40260-e492-57cb-bc61-911289ee9ea8'::uuid, 'document', 'approved_in_use'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '(doc review 6 Nov 2026) partnerships documented and approved: SP Res. 2023-347 and MOA with CPR-RIMT Rapid Rescue Rider Ormoc Chapter (volunteer augmentation); CDRRMC Res. 04 s.2025 MOA with all tertiary institutions (Education Resilience and DRRM Coordination Group); EO 2023-0026 Project TRANSFORM TWG with DENR, EDC and NRC under the Adopt-a-City Program; EDC, LEYECO V and 5 CSOs on the CDRRMC (EO 2024-032A); CPR-RIMT and two farmer cooperatives on the El Nino Task Force (EO 2023-0042). [Imported at "approved and in use" from the assessor''s score. Attach the document and proof of use, or lower the strength, at validation.]'),
('efaf9327-511e-51d4-9142-8063ada64afa'::uuid, '7ee40260-e492-57cb-bc61-911289ee9ea8'::uuid, 'document', 'approved_in_use'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '(issuances 2021-2024, read 6 Nov 2026) SP Res. 2021-036 (18 Jan 2021) authorised the MOA among the City, the National Resilience Council, the Carlos P. Romulo Foundation and EDC; SP Res. 2021-357 (Dec 2021) authorised an MOU with the Oscar M. Lopez Center on climate and geo-hazard research and training. [Imported at "approved and in use" from the assessor''s score. Attach the document and proof of use, or lower the strength, at validation.]'),
('ac891948-5c81-53ba-a4f1-5f8dbe4634a1'::uuid, 'f50a8b2a-b0c8-5c38-b9b3-581ecf480f2c'::uuid, 'fgd', 'verbal'::public.evidence_strength, 'CDRRMO field self-assessment (FGD), October 2026', 'CDRRMO section FGDs', 'scored 4.'),
('3ab1b092-e354-5abd-85fa-83a574801b74'::uuid, 'f50a8b2a-b0c8-5c38-b9b3-581ecf480f2c'::uuid, 'document', 'approved_in_use'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', 'RDRRMC8 Res. 12-006 (DILG VIII memo, 26 Feb 2025) requires the harmonized reporting template. [Imported at "approved and in use" from the assessor''s score. Attach the document and proof of use, or lower the strength, at validation.]'),
('021322d3-d7ba-5d23-9ba7-ba2afdc07fcf'::uuid, 'b0dde175-d7f2-5cca-a7ff-bf06c2aac1cb'::uuid, 'fgd', 'verbal'::public.evidence_strength, 'CDRRMO field self-assessment (FGD), October 2026', 'CDRRMO section FGDs', 'scored 2.'),
('92141378-7ca7-5231-86b9-6437bb029c2f'::uuid, 'b0dde175-d7f2-5cca-a7ff-bf06c2aac1cb'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '10-Yr Plan Ch.5 sets a results-based M&E design (UNDRR Ten Essentials base; NDRRMP, DILG capacity pillars and Sendai overlays), a Form 5D monitoring tool and five outputs (annual progress report each January, physical/financial report each December, mid-term report 2029), reported to the CDRRMC and LDC.'),
('de5678d7-da4c-5724-881f-714d0adc58e8'::uuid, 'b0dde175-d7f2-5cca-a7ff-bf06c2aac1cb'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '(doc review 6 Nov 2026) EO 2024-032A Sec. 2(a) tasks the CDRRMC to monitor and evaluate the LDRRMP; EO 2023-0026 tasks the Project TRANSFORM TWG to monitor indicators in the NRC resilience scorecard; CDP Vol. 2 sets vision success indicators for DRRM (e.g., share of budget to DRRM, Gawad KALASAG, BLS-trained ratio, barangay functionality). No annual M&E report in the set.'),
('034a6862-0780-5697-bc68-1ab1d9c0f57a'::uuid, 'b0dde175-d7f2-5cca-a7ff-bf06c2aac1cb'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '(issuances 2021-2024, read 6 Nov 2026) EO 2022-00020 created the CDRRMP Technical Working Group for formulation, implementation, monitoring and evaluation of the City DRRM Plan, with thematic focal offices (ENRO prevention-mitigation, DILG preparedness, CSWDO response, CPDO recovery).'),
('23698a03-4b4a-55f6-b8bc-61ff6047f6b2'::uuid, 'ce6172ba-aeb1-5845-aa3f-5fff5009754e'::uuid, 'fgd', 'verbal'::public.evidence_strength, 'CDRRMO field self-assessment (FGD), October 2026', 'CDRRMO section FGDs', 'scored 4.'),
