('a6f7f736-9fbb-519a-b384-2ea1e06ee3cd'::uuid, 'cc061ec2-0145-591c-9cca-6d70c4a9e58f'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', 'MCR2030 commitment and NRC Resilient LGU Program cited in 10-Yr Plan.'),
('36de7b73-c0db-5076-b805-f3c85d1e0bfc'::uuid, 'cc061ec2-0145-591c-9cca-6d70c4a9e58f'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '(doc review 6 Nov 2026) EO 2023-0026 records Ormoc as a signatory of the EDC-NRC Adopt-a-City MOA and the model LGU for DENR-EDC Project TRANSFORM; CDP strategy 5 adopts the UNDRR Ten Essentials. Changes resulting from these networks are not documented.'),
('4dc5bbf7-7b90-5d63-ae61-68f37688b265'::uuid, 'cc061ec2-0145-591c-9cca-6d70c4a9e58f'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '(issuances 2021-2024, read 6 Nov 2026) SP Res. 2021-036 (NRC-CPRF-EDC MOA, 2021) is the earlier basis of the NRC Resilient LGU partnership.'),
('22be0220-ecdc-569d-9533-868ce8dc38b2'::uuid, '67a69792-0f29-54e6-b586-e5c9de268741'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', 'activation SOP exists but is not SP-approved (field note, A2.5); no EO creating the EOC was sighted. 10-Yr Plan: OpCen/EOC operates 24/7 but needs a manual/SOP.'),
('b99fea34-60dc-540f-8320-8012b852ae8f'::uuid, '67a69792-0f29-54e6-b586-e5c9de268741'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '(doc review 6 Nov 2026) none of the 23 City issuances creates the EOC. EO 2024-032A (CDRRMC) does not mention the EOC or OpCen. CDP 2024-2030 has two separate programmes: 2.10 "Ormoc City DRRM Operations Center" (construction/repair, integrated operating systems, OpCen SOP/Manual) and 3.3 "Emergency Operations Center and Incident Command System Support".'),
('093319db-256d-5a3a-80df-1236141adbb6'::uuid, '67a69792-0f29-54e6-b586-e5c9de268741'::uuid, 'observation', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Site observation, October 2026', 'Assessment team site visit', '(Oct 2026 site visit) a developing EOC is co-located with the OpCen in the CDRRM Office and runs 24-hour duty for City Traffic Monitoring, Public Safety and Emergency Monitoring. This is an integrated operations-centre model (CDP strategy 2). No EO creating the EOC was found in the 2021-2024 issuances either.'),
('51156d2d-a052-5654-bd95-2918d0b50667'::uuid, '962ee543-8c2e-5526-b7fb-545f03d184f1'::uuid, 'document', 'approved_in_use'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', 'activation SOP (field note) and RDRRMC8 Res. 12-006 define White/Blue/Red; Blue = at least 50% of resources ready. RDRRMOC SOPG 2022 (OCD VIII) sets White, Blue and Red alerts with raising and downgrading rules for the regional OpCen. [Imported at "approved and in use" from the assessor''s score. Attach the document and proof of use, or lower the strength, at validation.]'),
