('007205ae-1769-5cb3-8fcb-f396b81de6db'::uuid, '21222890-22c7-5521-a159-2b30898d676e'::uuid, 'observation', 'approved_in_use'::public.evidence_strength, 'Site observation, October 2026', 'Assessment team site visit', '(Oct 2026 site visit) the EOC site was geospatially validated using KML coordinates and cross-referenced with official hazard maps. The facility is outside high-risk flood, landslide, tsunami and liquefaction zones, which meets recommended site-selection criteria for emergency operations facilities. The site is not named in the 10-Yr Plan, CLUP or CDRA. [Imported at "approved and in use" from the assessor''s score. Attach the document and proof of use, or lower the strength, at validation.]'),
('5607b4f7-6789-5eda-8ed5-0276bcc8e600'::uuid, '36bed9fd-238f-5c18-8e2a-ec505837bf6e'::uuid, 'observation', 'approved_in_use'::public.evidence_strength, 'Site observation, October 2026', 'Assessment team site visit', '(Oct 2026 site visit) the lead assessor sighted a structural assessment or occupancy permit for the EOC building. The 10-Yr Plan records city hall retrofitting (2016-2020); the ZO sets a 5-m easement on the Marina Fault trace. [Imported at "approved and in use" from the assessor''s score. Attach the document and proof of use, or lower the strength, at validation.]'),
('25ba5bf0-704d-5fe0-ba82-88f8027403a6'::uuid, '9f5775db-53b3-5711-8805-8f5ba837f7cf'::uuid, 'observation', 'approved_in_use'::public.evidence_strength, 'Site observation, October 2026', 'Assessment team site visit', '(Oct 2026 site visit) the lead assessor sighted generator or UPS capacity, a test log or a 72-hour fuel stock record. The 10-Yr Plan OpCen Program funds fuel and maintenance. [Imported at "approved and in use" from the assessor''s score. Attach the document and proof of use, or lower the strength, at validation.]'),
