('2fa58ec9-6b23-550a-8a8f-c4960cfca61f'::uuid, '65eaff76-960d-5c38-9ed9-a15cd45c5cd0'::uuid, 'document', 'partial'::public.evidence_strength, 'Desk review, October-November 2026', 'Consultant desk review', '(doc review 6 Nov 2026) CDP 2024-2030 PPA 2.18 plans BCP capacity building for barangays and MSMEs, a BCP template for MSMEs and incentives for MSMEs with a BCP; EDC and LEYECO V sit on the CDRRMC.')
